  "body": "Some locations are simply too good to overlook, and Hyde Road is certainly one of them.\r\n\r\nPositioned on one of Rothesay Bay and Browns Bay's most sought-after streets, this substantial family home offers an exciting opportunity to secure a prestigious coastal address, an extraordinary amount of space and the freedom to create something truly special.\r\n\r\nCherished by the same family for over 30 years, this has been a home filled with memories, laughter and family milestones. Now, with the children grown and having flown the nest, it's time for a new chapter and a new family to make it their own.\r\n\r\nSpace, Flexibility and Possibilities\r\n\r\nSpread across two generous levels, the home offers seven well-proportioned bedrooms, four and a half bathrooms, two living areas, a separate laundry and double internal-access garaging.\r\n\r\nThe versatility here is remarkable. A large or extended family, teenagers wanting their own space, guests staying over, or those working from home can all find room to spread out and enjoy a little independence.\r\n\r\nWith a brick lower level and weatherboard upper exterior, the home provides a substantial starting point for buyers with the vision to transform it.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 759m² of land, there's plenty of outdoor space for children to play, entertaining family and friends, or exploring future landscaping possibilities, perhaps even a swimming pool, subject to the necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nA Coastal Lifestyle Worth Coming Home To.\r\n\r\nFrom the upper level, enjoy lovely sea views towards Rothesay Bay Beach. On a quiet day, you can even hear the waves breaking along the shoreline. It's a wonderful reminder that you're living somewhere rather special.\r\n\r\nJust a short walk away is the heart of Browns Bay, where you'll find a vibrant village atmosphere, popular cafés, excellent restaurants, boutique shopping and everyday conveniences.\r\n\r\nWith both Browns Bay and Rothesay Bay beaches nearby, morning walks along the sand, summer swims and relaxed evenings by the water could become part of your everyday routine.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the sought-after school zoning for Browns Bay School and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nBring Your Vision. Create Something Special.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that could benefit with a bit of renovation, and we're not pretending otherwise. The kitchen, bathrooms and interiors are ready for updating, offering an exciting opportunity to introduce your own style and create a home that suits your needs.\r\n\r\nBut while interiors can be transformed, finding this amount of space in such a desirable coastal location is another matter entirely.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a substantial family home, room for multiple generations, or a rewarding renovation project, 19 Hyde Road deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptional. The space is impressive. The possibilities are yours to explore.\r\n\r\nHomes like this are best appreciated in person. Come and experience the scale, the outlook and the opportunity for yourself.\r\n\r\nContact Neil O'Gorman today or join us at the next open home.\r\n\r\nPlease note: Some marketing photographs have been digitally enhanced for presentation purposes. You are encouraged to inspect the property personally and undertake your own due diligence.",
